<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάσσω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάσω [ᾰ</span>]: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμᾰσα</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάς</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flog</i> horses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἵμασ᾽ Ἀντίλοχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.589
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.531
			</span></i>; of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . σε πληγῇσιν ἱμάσσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				857
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμασε χθόνα χειρί</span>
			<i>smote</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				340
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτε . . γαῖαν ἱμάσσῃ</span>
			when he <i>smites</i> it <i>with lightnings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.782
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμασσόμενος δέμας αὔραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.696
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				42.491
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
